{"suttaId":"thag6.8","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1859,1878],"vripara":"417"},"segments":{"thag6.8:0.4":"Migajālattheragāthā","thag6.8:1.1":"“Sudesito cakkhumatā, buddhenādiccabandhunā;","thag6.8:1.3":"Sabbasaṃyojanātīto, sabbavaṭṭavināsano.","thag6.8:2.1":"“Niyyāniko uttaraṇo, taṇhāmūlavisosano;","thag6.8:2.3":"Visamūlaṃ āghātanaṃ, chetvā pāpeti nibbutiṃ.","thag6.8:3.1":"“Aññāṇamūlabhedāya, kammayantavighāṭano;","thag6.8:3.3":"Viññāṇānaṃ pariggahe, ñāṇavajiranipātano.","thag6.8:4.1":"“Vedanānaṃ viññāpano, upādānappamocano;","thag6.8:4.3":"Bhavaṃ aṅgārakāsuṃva, ñāṇena anupassano [anupassako (sī. pī.)].","thag6.8:5.1":"“Mahāraso sugambhīro, jarāmaccunivāraṇo;","thag6.8:5.3":"Ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko maggo, dukkhūpasamano sivo.","thag6.8:6.1":"“Kammaṃ kammanti ñatvāna, vipākañca vipākato;","thag6.8:6.3":"Paṭiccuppannadhammānaṃ, yathāvālokadassano;","thag6.8:6.5":"Mahākhemaṅgamo santo, pariyosānabhaddako”ti.","thag6.8:6.7":"… Migajālo thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
